**结论：** 4 个案例、26 个候选全部审完，没有未决项。只有 2 个候选和来稿是同一条声明（案例 1 的 C1、案例 4 的 C10），其余 24 个都是不同的声明。没有发现更新、部分重叠或无法判断的情况。

```json
{
  "reviewed_cases": 4,
  "reviewed_candidates": 26,
  "unresolved": 0,
  "results": [
    {
      "case": "1",
      "judgments": [
        {
          "id": "C1",
          "relation": "same",
          "reason": "说话方都是 NVIDIA，两篇都在 2026-09-05 发表，说的是同一件事：DLSS 5 会支持 RTX 40。来稿多了先后顺序（先优化 RTX 50，再做 RTX 40）和秋季模型更新；候选只说'eventually'，没有日期。来稿只是同一声明更细的版本，没有改变或推翻它。两篇都没引用对方，所以无法从原文证明是同一份 NVIDIA 声明，但也看不出存在第二份内容不同的声明。",
          "evidence": {
            "incoming": "NVIDIA has officially confirmed that DLSS 5 will be introduced to previous-generation RTX 40 series GPUs.",
            "candidate": "Nvidia has confirmed that DLSS 5 will eventually make its way onto last-gen silicon as well."
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "C2",
          "relation": "different",
          "reason": "候选讲 DLSS 5 在 NBA 2K27 首发、目前只有这一款游戏原生支持。来稿只把首发当背景（\"The news comes days after NVIDIA launched DLSS 5 with NBA 2K 27\"），主体是 RTX 40 支持。",
          "evidence": null
        },
        {
          "id": "C3",
          "relation": "different",
          "reason": "候选是第三方开发者 danielblnc 做的 mod，让 DLSS 5 跑在 AMD RDNA 4 上。来稿是 NVIDIA 官方的 RTX 40 计划；来稿原文提到 mod 解锁了旧的 NVIDIA 显卡，但没提 AMD 的 mod。",
          "evidence": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "case": "2",
      "judgments": [
        {"id": "C1", "relation": "different", "reason": "讲 AMD 显卡上的 DLSS 5 mod，和 Cramer 引用的每股收益估计无关。", "evidence": null},
        {"id": "C2", "relation": "different", "reason": "讲 DLSS 5 在 NBA 2K27 首发，和每股收益估计无关。", "evidence": null},
        {"id": "C3", "relation": "different", "reason": "讲 NVIDIA 确认 DLSS 5 支持 RTX 40，和每股收益估计无关。", "evidence": null}
      ]
    },
    {
      "case": "3",
      "judgments": [
        {"id": "C1", "relation": "different", "reason": "SK Hynix CEO 说内存短缺可能持续到 2030。说话方和事实都不同；和来稿说的'供应受限'是同一话题，但不是同一条声明。", "evidence": null},
        {"id": "C2", "relation": "different", "reason": "AMD 上的 DLSS 5 mod，无关。", "evidence": null},
        {"id": "C3", "relation": "different", "reason": "DLSS 5 支持 RTX 40，无关。", "evidence": null},
        {"id": "C4", "relation": "different", "reason": "Amazon AWS 第二季度收入增长 37%，是另一家公司的业绩。", "evidence": null},
        {"id": "C5", "relation": "different", "reason": "同一次财报的背景，但说的是 NVIDIA 对供应商的承诺从 $119B 升到 $279B，不是 2028 财年收入增长约 70% 的指引。来稿原文里也有这句，但来稿这条声明没有收它。", "evidence": null},
        {"id": "C6", "relation": "different", "reason": "DLSS 5 在 NBA 2K27 首发，无关。", "evidence": null},
        {"id": "C7", "relation": "different", "reason": "Cramer 引用的每股收益估计（今年 $9.26、明年超过 $15）。说话方不同（评论员 vs NVIDIA 管理层），指标也不同（每股收益 vs 收入增长）。", "evidence": null},
        {"id": "C8", "relation": "different", "reason": "Micron 的指引是供应紧张会 'persist beyond calendar 2027'，是另一家公司的说法。", "evidence": null},
        {"id": "C9", "relation": "different", "reason": "SK Hynix 印第安纳工厂 2029 年下半年量产、造价 $4B，无关。", "evidence": null},
        {"id": "C10", "relation": "different", "reason": "NVIDIA 以 $12.9B 收购 Hugging Face，是另一件事。", "evidence": null}
      ]
    },
    {
      "case": "4",
      "judgments": [
        {"id": "C1", "relation": "different", "reason": "SK Hynix 印第安纳工厂，无关。", "evidence": null},
        {"id": "C2", "relation": "different", "reason": "Amazon AWS 第二季度业绩，是另一家公司。", "evidence": null},
        {"id": "C3", "relation": "different", "reason": "AMD 上的 DLSS 5 mod，无关。", "evidence": null},
        {"id": "C4", "relation": "different", "reason": "DLSS 5 支持 RTX 40，无关。", "evidence": null},
        {"id": "C5", "relation": "different", "reason": "Cramer 引用的每股收益估计，无关。", "evidence": null},
        {"id": "C6", "relation": "different", "reason": "Micron 对内存供应紧张的指引。和内存是同一话题，但说话方和事实都不同。", "evidence": null},
        {"id": "C7", "relation": "different", "reason": "DLSS 5 在 NBA 2K27 首发，无关。", "evidence": null},
        {"id": "C8", "relation": "different", "reason": "SK Hynix CEO 说内存短缺持续到 2030，说话方不同。", "evidence": null},
        {"id": "C9", "relation": "different", "reason": "NVIDIA 收购 Hugging Face，是另一件事。", "evidence": null},
        {
          "id": "C10",
          "relation": "same",
          "reason": "不只是数字一样：说话方相同（NVIDIA），时间点相同（第二季度末，对比上一季度），指标相同（对供应商的承诺），来源也是同一次披露（第二季度财报）。来稿多了按年份的排期（$92B / $87B / $88B）；候选多了 CFO Kress 的解释，说 $160B 的增量主要来自买内存。两边说法一致，没有冲突。",
          "evidence": {
            "incoming": "Nvidia exited the fiscal second quarter with $279 billion of supply and capacity commitments, up sequentially from $119 billion. These commitments are primarily related to memory purchases and manufacturing capacity.",
            "candidate": "The company increased its commitments to suppliers to $279 billion, up from $119 billion in the previous quarter. The $160 billion increase is primarily due to memory procurement, CFO Colette Kress wrote in her prepared statement accompanying the earnings release."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```

**需要留意的一点：** 案例 1 的 C1 我判为 same，但来稿比候选多了"先 RTX 50、后 RTX 40"的先后顺序。如果下一步把来稿当作重复直接丢掉，这条顺序信息就会丢失。

我只读了 `blind-batch-1.json` 这一个文件，没有改动或发送任何内容。另外，Gmail、Google Calendar、Google Drive 这三个连接器还没授权，要去 claude.ai 的连接器设置里开通才能用；这次审核用不到它们。

